      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a great start, thanks. To make the chapter balanced, I also need to address the counter-arguments. Could you summarize the main scientific or psychological arguments used to defend the validity and objectivity of IQ and standardized testing as measures of cognitive ability? I want to make sure I'm not just presenting a one-sided view in my paper.",
